<p>If you run a salon or spa, you already know the rhythm. The phone rings while you are mid-colour. A client texts asking for availability while you are wrist-deep in a facial. Someone wants to rebook but your receptionist is on lunch. By the time you get back to them, they have booked somewhere else.</p>

<p>Phone tag is not just annoying. It is costing you real money. Every missed call is a potential booking lost. Every "I'll call you back" that never happens is revenue walking out the door. And every hour you spend managing your calendar manually is an hour you could spend doing what you actually love: making people look and feel incredible.</p>

<p>A proper <strong>salon booking system</strong> changes all of this. When clients can book online at any hour, when reminders go out automatically, and when lapsed clients get a gentle nudge to come back, your calendar fills itself. You stop chasing. You start growing.</p>

